    "detailed_description": "We believe that any of us had a situation when he fractured his hand or had a problem that needed to be cured. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFix My Hand Doc is a simulator that teaches you how to proceed in various extreme situations. Your mission is to be a doctor who will have to treat the hands of different patients. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDon't worry, get over your emotions and everything will be fine. Just remember, don't rush! Good luck doc!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features : <br />\r\n- Various cases with fractures or infections of the hand(use of ointment, patch, x-ray)<br />\r\n- Patients waiting for help<br />\r\n- Robot auto helper",
